Privacy Case, The Always-On Microphone, audio recordings, A smart speaker company recorded household conversations even when the device was not activated. Employees reviewed the recordings.
Algorithm Case, The Biased Hiring Bot, gender bias, A tech company's AI screening tool ranked male applicants higher than equally qualified female applicants.
Misinformation Case, The Deepfake Politician, deepfake video, A deepfake video of a candidate saying things they never said spread widely online during an election before being identified as fake.
Intellectual Property Case, AI Trained on Artist Work, AI-generated art, An AI image generator was trained on millions of artworks scraped without permission. Artists receive no credit or payment.
Privacy Case, The Fitness App Leak, location tracking, A fitness app accidentally exposed users’ location data, revealing sensitive information such as home addresses and military base activity.
Algorithm Case, The Unequal Loan System, Racial bias, A bank’s AI loan approval system gave lower credit scores and higher rejection rates to applicants from certain racial communities.
Intellectual Property Case, The Stolen Voice Clone, AI voice replication, An AI company copied a famous voice actor’s recordings to create a synthetic voice without consent or compensation.
Misinformation Case,  The Fake Health Rumor, false social media posts, Viral posts online falsely claimed that a common vaccine caused severe illnesses, leading many people to avoid vaccination before experts corrected the misinformation.